OL,3,GNEWSATwo hurt and power cut as truck
OL,4,Acrashes into house
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people are in hospital and more
OL,7,Fthan a dozen homes are without power
OL,8,Fafter a pick-up truck crashed into a
OL,9,Fhouse during the night.
OL,11,FThe truck ploughed through a fence and
OL,12,Fgarden of a bungalow in Church Road,
OL,13,FPimperne, at about 01:20 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FDorset Police said the occupants of the
OL,17,Fvehicle were taken to hospital but it
OL,18,Fwas unable to confirm their condition.
OL,20,FPower distribution company SSEN said
OL,21,Fabout 16 homes were without power while
OL,22,Fsafety checks were carried out.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
